2026-10-16 | Knowledge base | The /knowledge-base index 301-redirects to /guides and is not in the sitemap. | Gemini (HM227B) | firebase.json; apps/hilmost_toolbox_web/src/app/sitemap.ts
2026-10-16 | hilmost.net homepage | Live homepage is the Next.js app (apps/hilmost_main). It links to real tool pages, /guides and the blog, and has no /knowledge-base links. apps/hilmost_main/public/index.html is an uncommitted leftover file that is NOT what hilmost.net serves. | Claude live check | https://hilmost.net
2026-10-16 | AdSense | hilmost.net status "Getting ready" (review requested 13 Oct 2026); Ads.txt status "Authorized". Status changes over time: recheck in AdSense > Sites. | Claude (AdSense console, read-only) | AdSense > Sites
2026-10-16 | hilmost.net SEO metadata | Every hilmost.net page sets a self-referencing canonical and its own og:url via pageMeta() in apps/hilmost_main/src/lib/seo.ts; shared og siteName/type/image live in BASE_OPEN_GRAPH. The root layout no longer hard-codes og:url. | Claude live check + Gemini (HM228, HM228B) | apps/hilmost_main/src/lib/seo.ts
2026-10-16 | Next.js gotcha | A page that sets `openGraph` replaces the root layout's whole openGraph object, so always build page openGraph via pageMeta() (it includes BASE_OPEN_GRAPH). | Gemini (HM228) | apps/hilmost_main/src/lib/seo.ts
